            "id": "f5be1dc1-fb9c-325e-a6d9-725fe8666ba2",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Redwood Trust (RWT): Rapid Earnings Growth Forecast Tests Confidence in Profitability Turnaround",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Redwood Trust (RWT) remains unprofitable, but over the past five years, the company has steadily narrowed its annual losses by 2.3%. Looking ahead, earnings are forecast to grow rapidly at 98.07% per year, while revenue is expected to climb 21.4% annually. This is more than double the 10.3% pace predicted for the broader US market. At $5.34, shares trade well below the estimated fair value of $9.83, setting up a mix of caution and optimism for investors tracking the path to profitability. See...",
